Busyboard is a wonderful children's game created for the development of a child in a playful way.
These educational games are suitable for both girls and boys from 1 to 4 years old.
With their help, kids can improve skills such as visual perception, concentration, logical thinking and fine motor skills.
	✔ Drawing: learning to draw on a slate board with multi-colored crayons;
	✔ Animal sounds: learn the sounds of various animals;
	✔ Kids calculator - learn arithmetic.
	✔ Zipper: we train hand motility.
	✔ Spinner, klaxon, bell: over 300 different sounds and elements to interact with.
	✔ Musical instruments: piano, xylophone, drums, harp, saxophone, flute - all the sounds of real and high-quality instruments, reveal the musical potential of your baby.
	✔ Change of day and night in the game - kids will get basic knowledge about the change of day and night;
	✔ Change of weather in the game - we study the weather conditions;
	✔ Transport for kids: sounds and animations of air and ground transport;
	✔ Numbers 1 2 3 ... - learn to count;
	✔ Light bulbs, toggle switches, buttons, switches, voltmeter, fan - you can play with all the elements of the game;
	✔ Clock, alarm clock - learning time and numbers;
	✔ Cubes: we study the interaction of simple figures in the world of physics;
	✔ Funny sounds from cartoons;

Benefits of our game:
	💕 Intuitive, colorful and vibrant interface;
	💕 You can click on everything that is drawn;
	💕 Absolutely free (no purchases of additional content);
	💕 Very easy to use;
	💕 Optimized for phones and tablets;
	💕 Translated into major European languages;

Toddlers will certainly enjoy this children's game.

Pepi Bath 2 is s a fun way to experience daily bathroom routines with your toddler and take care of cute, little friends.

The app has 7 different situations, about daily hygiene habits, in which you will get to meet four cute Pepi characters: a boy, a girl, a little kitten and friendly dog. Choose one of them and do various fun things together: wash hands, do laundry, brush teeth, take a bath, use a potty and dress up. Learning while playing is fun, but it gets even better when soap bubbles get involved!

Pepi Bath 2 can be played both as a set process of bathroom routines habits or without any pre-set sequence. Kids and their parents are free to choose what they want to do and after you help your chosen character to wash hands, do laundry, use a potty, do not forget play time with soap bubbles. 

If you want to truly experience the benefits of this app, play together with your toddler, talk about daily bathroom habits and the importance of personal hygiene. 

Pepi Bath 2 has excellent graphics, wide range of emotions and sounds. All characters (a boy, a girl, a kitten and a doggy) react to toddler’s actions and after completing a challenge, everyone will be awarded with cheerful applause!

Key features:
• 4 cute characters: a boy, a girl, a kitten and a doggy;
• 7 different daily bathroom routines: wash hands, use potty, do laundry, play with soap bubbles and more;
• Colourful animations and hand-drawn characters; 
• Stunning sound effects, no verbal language;
• No rules, win or lose situations;
• Recommended age for little players: from 2 to 6 years.

Discover and explore the modern medical center, and create your stories as a doctor, patient, or scientist! With unique gameplay, learn how to prevent infections with vaccines, masks, and hand disinfection in a fun and interactive way. 

FUTURE CLINIC AND CUTE BOTS 

This game takes you to a flu clinic of the future, where you'll meet 7 kid-friendly robots as doctors and medical staff. This modern medical center is filled with the latest interactive technologies in every part of the building for you to explore and create your stories: from a bacteria lab to a helicopter ambulance, from a lobby filled with mini games to a science lab. 

NEW HOSPITAL EXPERIENCES 

Same as in the first edition of Pepi Hospital, this flu clinic of the future encourages you to create your own stories and is also filled with a wide range of new activities: become a doctor and treat patients with the latest interactive devices and prevent infections with anti-virus vaccines; play the role of a scientist and experiment with bacteria using various science lab equipment; or take on the role of a patient and receive care from adorable Pepi robots. 

INTERACTIVE GAMEPLAY 

We loaded the medical center with unique gameplay elements to make your future flu clinic stories even more enjoyable and unforgettable. Each room has a variety of interactive areas for you to explore, including smart screens that can help doctors to identify different patients’ needs, modern science lab equipment to experiment with, and a mini-games screen in the lobby. 

KEEP THE EDUCATION FUN 

The game encourages family play and collaboration while integrating educational elements! Join the kids as they explore the medical center's exciting features, guide their exploration, and assist them in learning fundamental medical information about the spread of diseases, vaccines, and the importance of prevention. At the same time, help them to develop stories about various characters, explain the purpose of different medical devices, and expand their vocabulary. 

KEY FEATURES:
• Unique gameplay that simulates virus infections;
• Colorful and engaging graphics presenting flu clinic of the future;
• 30+ amazing characters: doctors, patients, robots, and visitors;
• 7 friendly robot doctors that will help to treat patients and much more;
• Experiment in the science lab with different bacteria;
• Mini-games screen with 3 enjoyable games;
• Explore dozens of medical devices, items, and machines to experiment with;
• A helicopter ambulance brings patients onto the hospital roof;
• Learn about hygiene: use hand sanitizers and masks to prevent flu.
